<p><span id="u-credit-00473" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00473" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00473-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/allen-z" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5991926); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5991926&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609316847" alt="Allen Z" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5991926)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/allen-z" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5991926); return false;">Allen Z</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1606708536 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 Nov 2020 03:55</span></p>
